// M111 lane TH (D91.19 and its amendment): the desktop's theme outputs,
// generated from M114's resolved token file
// (design/tokens/generated/consumers.json), never from a second source.
// Reads the resolved JSON only; design/tokens/muse.tokens.json and
// scripts/build-tokens.mjs are M114 lane 0's and stay read-only.
//
// Outputs (all under desktop/shell/theme/ and desktop/crates/tokens/, also
// generated by this script): the Qt shell's QML singleton, one resolved
// palette stylesheet per mode, the Rust constants, the Hyprland Lua data
// table, xterm.js and CodeMirror themes per mode, the pointer and icon
// palettes, the wallpaper recipe, and the boot values (Plymouth script and
// GRUB theme, asset-free). `node scripts/build-tokens-desktop.mjs --check`
// (wired into `npm run check:tokens`) regenerates every byte and proves the
// desktop contrast pairs in all four modes.
//
// Design record: docs/certification/rlf-m111th.md.
